{"seq":3,"slug":"freelist-integrity-check-corruption-repair","title":"空闲页链表、完整性校验与文件损坏恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/sqlite-embedded-database-internals-engineering/file-format-page-btree/freelist-integrity-check-corruption-repair","wordCount":2579,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"空闲页链表-完整性校验与文件损坏恢复\">空闲页链表、完整性校验与文件损坏恢复</h1><p>一个跑了三年的门店收银库，叶子页里堆满删除订单留下的空位，文件从 40MB 涨到 210MB 却不见缩；某次断电后 <code>PRAGMA integrity_check</code> 一口气吐出 17 行错误，<code>sqlite3</code> 甚至直接连不上。这两件事同源：SQLite 把「被删除的页」和「正在用的页」放在同一个定长页数组里管理，前者靠**空闲页链表（freelist）**串起来，链表指针一旦和实际页冲突，库就从「浪费空间」变成「结构损坏」。本文顺着 <strong>freelist 布局 → 完整性校验边界 → <code>.recover</code> 抢救路径</strong> 这条链，讲清字段偏移、校验的能查与查不出，以及 2026 年那条把库悄悄改坏的 WAL 竞态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-删除的页为什么还留在文件里\">核心概念：删除的页为什么还留在文件里</h2><p>SQLite 数据库文件是一个<strong>定长页数组</strong>，页号从 1 开始。删行、删表、删索引都不会把页交还给文件系统，SQLite 只把腾空的页挂回一条内部链表——<strong>空闲页链表（freelist）</strong>，下次需要新页时优先复用，而不是把文件撑长。所以「删了 80% 数据文件却只小几 MB」不是没删干净，是空间躺在 freelist 里等复用（<a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/fileformat2.html\">sqlite.org/fileformat2.html</a> §1.5）。围绕它有三个咬合的问题：<strong>布局</strong>（能否读对）、<strong>校验</strong>（<code>integrity_check</code> 能查出什么）、<strong>抢救</strong>（<code>.recover</code> 的回收上限）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"空闲页链表-trunk-与-leaf-的字节布局\">空闲页链表：trunk 与 leaf 的字节布局</h2><p>freelist 是<strong>两级</strong>结构：一组 trunk 页串成单链表，每个 trunk 页再挂若干 leaf 页。文件头里有两个入口字段，都是 4 字节大端：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"right\">偏移</th>\n<th align=\"right\">大小</th>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"right\">32</td>\n<td align=\"right\">4</td>\n<td>first freelist trunk</td>\n<td>首个空闲 trunk 页号；0 表示链表为空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">36</td>\n<td align=\"right\">4</td>\n<td>freelist page count</td>\n<td>空闲页总数（trunk + leaf 都算）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>trunk 页没有 b-tree 页头，整页就是一个 4 字节大端整数数组，容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\lfloor U / 4 \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord\">/4</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 为可用页大小）：下标 0 是下一个 trunk 页号（0 表示链表末节点），下标 1 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>（本页后面还有多少 leaf 页号），下标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>…</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\dots L+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 个 leaf 页号。</p>\n<p>可用页最小 480 字节，故 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\ge 120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span>。<strong>leaf 页里不存任何有意义的数据</strong>——SQLite 不会因为它们在 freelist 上就去读写，也不会在复用前把它们拷进回滚日志。这条约定正是恢复工具的理论支点：freelist 上任何一页若被查出被别处引用，就是冲突。</p>\n<p>一个坑：trunk 数组的<strong>最后六个槽位不参与分配</strong>，这是兼容 3.6.0 之前一个损坏 bug 的产物，故可用 leaf 指针上限是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C - 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>480</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U = 480</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">480</span></span></span></span></span> 时为 112）。按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C-2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 算容量会在写满边界时误判溢出。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  H[&quot;文件头偏移 32&lt;br/&gt;first trunk 页号&quot;] --&gt; T1[trunk 页 #7&lt;br/&gt;[next=13, L=3, 20,21,22]&quot;]&#10;  T1 --&gt; T2[trunk 页 #13&lt;br/&gt;[next=0, L=2, 40,41]&quot;]&#10;  T1 --&gt; L1[&quot;leaf 页 #20/#21/#22&lt;br/&gt;无内容&quot;]&#10;  T2 --&gt; L2[&quot;leaf 页 #40/#41&lt;br/&gt;无内容&quot;]&#10;  H2[&quot;偏移 36 空闲页总数 = 10&quot;] -.计数.-&gt; T1\">graph TD\n  H[\"文件头偏移 32&lt;br/&gt;first trunk 页号\"] --&gt; T1[trunk 页 #7&lt;br/&gt;[next=13, L=3, 20,21,22]\"]\n  T1 --&gt; T2[trunk 页 #13&lt;br/&gt;[next=0, L=2, 40,41]\"]\n  T1 --&gt; L1[\"leaf 页 #20/#21/#22&lt;br/&gt;无内容\"]\n  T2 --&gt; L2[\"leaf 页 #40/#41&lt;br/&gt;无内容\"]\n  H2[\"偏移 36 空闲页总数 = 10\"] -.计数.-&gt; T1</pre><h2 id=\"空闲页的回收时机与-auto_vacuum-ptrmap\">空闲页的回收时机与 auto_vacuum / ptrmap</h2><p>freelist 只保证「页可复用」，不保证「文件会变小」。想真正把尾部空闲页截掉，只有两条路：<code>VACUUM</code> 重建整个库，或开启 <strong>auto-vacuum</strong>。三种模式差异明显（<a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/pragma.html#pragma_auto_vacuum\">sqlite.org/pragma.html#pragma_auto_vacuum</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th align=\"right\">值</th>\n<th>提交时行为</th>\n<th>关键限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NONE</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0</td>\n<td>空闲页留在 freelist，文件不缩</td>\n<td>默认；需手动 <code>VACUUM</code> 才回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FULL</td>\n<td align=\"right\">1</td>\n<td>每次提交把 freelist 页搬到文件尾并截断</td>\n<td><strong>不</strong>整理碎片，搬页反而可能加剧碎片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INCREMENTAL</td>\n<td align=\"right\">2</td>\n<td>提交时不动；靠 <code>PRAGMA incremental_vacuum(N)</code> 手动截断</td>\n<td>能精细控制，不阻塞写事务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>auto-vacuum 的代价是额外的<strong>指针映射页（ptrmap）</strong>，它提供「从子页反查父页」的能力——否则搬运一个页后无法修正指向它的引用。ptrmap 只在文件头偏移 52 非零时存在，第一张固定第 2 页，此后按「一页 ptrmap + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span> 页数据」成块重复，每条记录 5 字节（1 字节类型码 + 4 字节大端父页号）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mi>U</mi><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>96</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>ptrmap_pgno</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>J</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{U}{5} \\right\\rfloor \\ge 96,\\qquad \\text{ptrmap\\_pgno}(p) = 2 + \\left\\lfloor \\frac{p-3}{J+1} \\right\\rfloor \\cdot (J+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">96</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ptrmap_pgno</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>类型码 5 种：1 = <code>PTRMAP_ROOTPAGE</code>（根页）、2 = <code>PTRMAP_FREEPAGE</code>（freelist 页）、3 = <code>PTRMAP_OVERFLOW1</code>（溢出链首页）、4 = <code>PTRMAP_OVERFLOW2</code>（溢出链后续页）、5 = <code>PTRMAP_BTREE</code>（非根 b-tree 页）。这里正是恢复工具的第二支点：<code>PTRMAP_FREEPAGE</code> 明确标注「这一页应属 freelist」。若某页既是 b-tree 页又被 ptrmap 标为 FREEPAGE（或反之），就是可定位的交叉引用冲突——<code>integrity_check</code> 报的「sections used more than once」多半就是这类。<code>PRAGMA freelist_count</code> 是判断「要不要触发 <code>incremental_vacuum</code>」的前置指标：它非零且持续增长，说明删除量已追上写入量，此时 <code>PRAGMA incremental_vacuum(100)</code> 可按需回收，而不必全库 <code>VACUUM</code>（全量 <code>VACUUM</code> 需两倍磁盘并长时间持锁，移动端代价尤高）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pragma-integrity_check-与-quick_check-的检查边界\">PRAGMA integrity_check 与 quick_check 的检查边界</h2><p><code>PRAGMA integrity_check</code> 做的事是<strong>全库结构的底层扫描</strong>：逐页遍历 b-tree、核对索引、再把 freelist 与 ptrmap 交叉验证。它报出的类别包括条目顺序错乱、记录格式畸形、<strong>页丢失</strong>、索引与表内容不一致、UNIQUE/CHECK/NOT NULL 被破坏、freelist 不一致，以及「同一段被引用多次或从未被引用」（<a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/pragma.html#pragma_integrity_check\">sqlite.org/pragma.html#pragma_integrity_check</a>）。无错返回单行 <code>ok</code>，有错每行一条字符串，默认最多 100 条，可用 <code>integrity_check(1000)</code> 放大上限。这几个边界必须记住，否则会把「检查通过」误当成「数据可信」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>pragma</th>\n<th>耗时</th>\n<th>会查</th>\n<th><strong>不会查</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>integrity_check</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N \\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>结构 + 索引一致性 + UNIQUE/CHECK/NOT NULL</td>\n<td>外键约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>quick_check</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>结构（跳过索引 vs 表比对）</td>\n<td>UNIQUE、索引一致性、外键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>foreign_key_check</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>外键</td>\n<td>结构损坏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>integrity_check(表名)</code></td>\n<td>局部</td>\n<td>该表及其索引</td>\n<td><strong>未使用区段、跨表重复引用</strong>；freelist 仅在目标是 <code>sqlite_schema</code> 时校验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>quick_check</code> 把代价从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N \\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，因为它跳过了「索引逐条与表比对」和 UNIQUE 校验——这也是它查不出唯一索引被破坏的原因。局部检查（3.33.0 起支持）还有个反直觉的副作用：只查一张表时，库<strong>无法</strong>判断文件里是否存在没人引用的孤儿区段，也无法发现两个表用了同一段，因为这需要全库视角。</p>\n<p>实践中把命令排成流水线：常规巡检用 <code>quick_check</code>（移动端可在低峰跑），发布前或恢复后用 <code>integrity_check</code> 全量核验，业务约束补 <code>foreign_key_check</code>。注意它只检查<strong>结构与声明约束</strong>，不查应用语义——一行订单的 <code>total</code> 与明细之和不符，任何 pragma 都不会报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"recover-从损坏文件里抢救数据\">.recover：从损坏文件里抢救数据</h2><p><code>integrity_check</code> 只能<strong>诊断</strong>，要恢复得换工具。命令行 shell 的 <code>.dump</code> 通过正常 SQL 接口导出，碰到损坏页就在第一处停下；<code>.recover</code> 则<strong>绕开 SQL 接口，直接从尽可能多的页里重组数据</strong>，官方说法是「通常能从所有未损坏部分恢复，而 <code>.dump</code> 一遇到第一个损坏迹象就停止」（<a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/cli.html\">sqlite.org/cli.html</a>）。它扫描每页、尽力把内容认回所属的表，因此能跨单页损坏继续走；但「认不回」的行不会丢失，而是被塞进合成表 <code>lost_and_found</code>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>列</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>rootpgno</code></td>\n<td>该行所属 b-tree 的根页；无法识别时填 <code>pgno</code> 自身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pgno</code></td>\n<td>发现该行的物理页号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>nfield</code></td>\n<td>该行的字段数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>id</code></td>\n<td>普通表的 rowid；WITHOUT ROWID 表为 NULL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>c0, c1, c2, …</code></td>\n<td>恢复出的字段值，列数按最长孤儿行补齐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>之所以会有「索引条目」也掉进 <code>lost_and_found</code>，是因为 SQLite 里<strong>索引条目和 WITHOUT ROWID 表条目共用同一种记录格式</strong>，扫描器无法仅凭字节区分。若一次恢复产生多个同名表，会自动加数字后缀（<code>lost_and_found0</code>…），也可用 <code>.recover --lost-and-found</code> 指定名字。抢救流程：跑 <code>.recover</code> 导出为 SQL 脚本 → 建新库导入 → 再跑 <code>integrity_check</code> 与 <code>foreign_key_check</code> 确认干净 → 用 <code>lost_and_found</code> 里的行做人工对账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"损坏的根因分类与-2026-年的-wal-reset-竞态\">损坏的根因分类与 2026 年的 WAL-reset 竞态</h2><p>绝大多数「SQLite 损坏」都不是 SQLite 的锅。官方 <code>howtocorrupt</code> 文档把成因分成几类（<a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/howtocorrupt.html\">sqlite.org/howtocorrupt.html</a>，2026-04-13 更新）：外部覆盖文件（把库当普通文件写、误删 hot journal）、锁协议被破坏（NFS 锁语义、绕过 SQLite 直接 <code>close()</code> 清掉 POSIX 建议锁）、存储谎报 <code>fsync</code> 完成、断电打断 WAL checkpoint、硬件/文件系统故障、应用内存越界，以及主动关掉保护（<code>synchronous=OFF</code>、<code>journal_mode=OFF</code>）。对应做法很朴素：保持默认 <code>synchronous=FULL</code>、保留 <code>-journal</code>/<code>-wal</code> 辅助文件、全库统一一种锁协议与一份 SQLite 副本、热备份用 <code>VACUUM INTO</code> 而非事务中裸拷文件。</p>\n<p><strong>2026 年需要特别留意一条真实存在过的内核级竞态</strong>：WAL-reset 竞态，影响 <strong>3.7.0（2010-07-21）到 3.51.2（2026-01-09）</strong>，2026-03-03 发现并修复，修复版本 <strong>3.51.3（2026-03-13）</strong>，回移到 <strong>3.44.6</strong> 与 <strong>3.50.7</strong>（<a href=\"https://sqlite.org/wal.html\">sqlite.org/wal.html</a>）。触发条件是 WAL 模式下同一库有<strong>两个及以上连接</strong>并发写/检查点。链路是：第一次 checkpoint 跑完、WAL 可被 reset；第二次 checkpoint 刚启动时，另一连接提交并 reset 了 WAL、把新帧写在开头；竞态使第二次 checkpoint 没察觉 reset，误标「这些页已检查点」；后续提交把 WAL 撑过首次 checkpoint 的页数；第三次 checkpoint 于是<strong>跳过</strong>了那次事务——其内容永远没进主库，表现为「已提交数据消失」，是静默损坏而非报错。官方评估其现实概率与 SSD 故障同级，属「该升级但不紧急」；但对跨境电商设备端（POS、扫码枪、边缘网关）这类常年离线、多进程共用本地库的形态正好落在触发窗口上——应升到 3.51.3 以上，或用 <code>PRAGMA locking_mode=EXCLUSIVE</code> 收敛到单连接，消除并发写检查点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>freelist 是两级链表</strong>：文件头偏移 32/36 给出首 trunk 页与总空闲页数；trunk 页是 4 字节大端数组，下标 0 是 next、1 是 leaf 数、之后是 leaf 页号。leaf 页无内容，可用 leaf 指针上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C-8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>（末六槽为兼容旧版保留）。</li>\n<li><strong>回收时机</strong>：默认 NONE 不缩文件；<code>incremental_vacuum(N)</code> 可按需截断；auto-vacuum 引入每页 5 字节 ptrmap（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J = \\lfloor U/5 \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord\">/5</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span>），用它反查父页才能搬运页。</li>\n<li><strong>校验边界</strong>：<code>integrity_check</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N \\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 全量结构核验，<code>quick_check</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 但跳过索引与 UNIQUE；二者都不查外键；局部检查无法发现孤儿区段与跨表重复引用。</li>\n<li><strong>恢复路径</strong>：<code>.recover</code> 直接扫页重组，能跨损坏点继续，认不回的行进 <code>lost_and_found</code>；索引条目与 WITHOUT ROWID 行同格式，故可能混入。</li>\n<li><strong>根因优先排查外部因素</strong>：锁协议、<code>fsync</code> 谎报、hot journal 缺失、<code>synchronous=OFF</code>；并升级到 3.51.3 / 3.44.6 / 3.50.7。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同章姊妹篇：<a href=\"db-file-header-page-types\">数据库文件头、页类型与页大小</a> 讲页头与 <code>sqlite_schema</code>；<a href=\"btree-cell-record-varint-overflow\">表/索引 B-Tree、cell 与记录格式</a> 讲 cell、varint 与溢出页链如何决定一页能装多少行；<a href=\"../wal-lock-concurrency/rollback-journal-vs-wal-checkpoint\">回滚日志 vs WAL 与 checkpoint</a> 讲 checkpoint 与损坏。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"空闲页链表、完整性校验与文件损坏恢复","id":"空闲页链表-完整性校验与文件损坏恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：删除的页为什么还留在文件里","id":"核心概念-删除的页为什么还留在文件里"},{"level":2,"text":"空闲页链表：trunk 与 leaf 的字节布局","id":"空闲页链表-trunk-与-leaf-的字节布局"},{"level":2,"text":"空闲页的回收时机与 auto_vacuum / ptrmap","id":"空闲页的回收时机与-auto_vacuum-ptrmap"},{"level":2,"text":"PRAGMA integrity_check 与 quick_check 的检查边界","id":"pragma-integrity_check-与-quick_check-的检查边界"},{"level":2,"text":".recover：从损坏文件里抢救数据","id":"recover-从损坏文件里抢救数据"},{"level":2,"text":"损坏的根因分类与 2026 年的 WAL-reset 竞态","id":"损坏的根因分类与-2026-年的-wal-reset-竞态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"表/索引 B-Tree、cell 与记录格式（varint serial type、溢出页）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/sqlite-embedded-database-internals-engineering/file-format-page-btree/btree-cell-record-varint-overflow"},"next":{"title":"回滚日志 vs WAL 模式与 checkpoint 机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/sqlite-embedded-database-internals-engineering/wal-lock-concurrency/rollback-journal-vs-wal-checkpoint"}}